  m_Text: 'Captivity



    Thank you for playing my game. I hope you enjoyed it!


    I
    started out with this game as a learning project and hobby.

    I hope this
    game has evolved to point where you think it''s fun and worth the money

    you
    decided to pay for it.


    If this game is liked and played enough, I will
    add more stages with new enemies and challenges.


    Again: thank you for playing
    and I appreciate your support!



    -Perveloper'
